// Three sparks whose ring sets touch.
name Trinity
rule B1/S
steps 3
hint Three sparks this time. Where ring sets meet, the touching cells were never born.
tip Each ring set is centred two cells diagonally from its spark. Two sparks sit on one row, the third below them.
